#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:5
msgid "Admissions"
msgstr "Admissions"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:8
msgid ""
"The Resthome Admissions application: a pipeline from the first enquiry to "
"the move-in, the candidate's file, and the admission that creates the "
"resident and their stay."
msgstr ""
"L'application Admissions de Resthome : un pipeline de la première demande à "
"l'emménagement, le dossier du candidat, et l'admission qui crée l'habitant "
"et son séjour."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:12
msgid "Where is the admissions pipeline?"
msgstr "Où se trouve le pipeline des admissions ?"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:13
msgid ""
"In the **Admissions** application. Each enquiry is a card that you move from"
" stage to stage on a kanban board."
msgstr ""
"Dans l'application **Admissions**. Chaque demande est une carte que vous "
"faites avancer d'étape en étape sur un tableau kanban."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:15
msgid "Who is the candidate, the resident or the relative who calls?"
msgstr "Qui est le candidat, l'habitant ou le proche qui appelle ?"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:16
msgid ""
"The candidate is the person to be accommodated. The relative who calls is "
"recorded as a family contact, and the identity (national identification "
"number, date of birth) stays on the candidate."
msgstr ""
"Le candidat est la personne à héberger. Le proche qui appelle est enregistré"
" comme contact famille, et l'identité (numéro d'identification national, "
"date de naissance) reste sur le candidat."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:18
msgid "How do I close an enquiry that does not go ahead?"
msgstr "Comment clôturer une demande qui n'aboutit pas ?"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:19
msgid ""
"Click **Give up** on the file and choose the reason: admitted to another "
"home, withdrew and staying at home, or died before admission."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur **Abandonner** sur le dossier et choisissez le motif : admis "
"dans une autre maison de repos, renonce et reste à domicile, ou décédé avant"
" l'admission."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:29
msgid ""
"The **Admissions** application follows every enquiry, from a relative's "
"first phone call to the day the resident moves in. Each enquiry is a "
"**file** that you move forward on a kanban board; when it is ready, one "
"action turns the candidate into a **resident**, with their room and their "
"stay."
msgstr ""
"L'application **Admissions** suit chaque demande, du premier appel d'un "
"proche au jour de l'emménagement. Chaque demande est un **dossier** que vous"
" faites avancer sur un tableau kanban ; quand il est prêt, un seul geste "
"transforme le candidat en **habitant**, avec sa chambre et son séjour."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:34
msgid ""
"![Admissions pipeline in kanban view, one column per stage from First "
"contact to Admitted](../assets/screenshots/residents/01-pipeline-"
"admissions.webp)"
msgstr ""
"![Le pipeline des admissions en kanban, une colonne par étape, du premier "
"contact à l'admission](../assets/screenshots/residents/01-pipeline-"
"admissions.webp)"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:34
msgid ""
"Admissions pipeline in kanban view, one column per stage from First contact "
"to Admitted"
msgstr ""
"Le pipeline des admissions en kanban, une colonne par étape, du premier "
"contact à l'admission"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:36
msgid "The stages"
msgstr "Les étapes"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "Étape"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Ce que ça veut dire"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**First Contact**"
msgstr "**Premier contact**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "Enquiry received, to be followed up."
msgstr "Demande reçue, à recontacter."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**Visit Scheduled**"
msgstr "**Visite planifiée**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "A visit to the facility has been booked."
msgstr "Une visite de la maison est fixée."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**Visit Completed**"
msgstr "**Visite effectuée**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "The visit has taken place."
msgstr "La visite a eu lieu."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**File Complete**"
msgstr "**Dossier complet**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "The administrative and medical file is ready."
msgstr "Le dossier administratif et médical est prêt."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**Admitted**"
msgstr "**Admis**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "Triggers the admission — see [Admitting a candidate](admettre.md)."
msgstr "Déclenche l'admission — voir [Admettre un candidat](admettre.md)."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "**Refused / Withdrawn**"
msgstr "**Refusé / Désisté**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:22
msgid "The enquiry does not go ahead (folded column)."
msgstr "La demande n'aboutit pas (colonne repliée)."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:47
msgid ""
"Drag a card from one column to the next, at the actual pace of the case. "
"Visits can also be scheduled from the file itself, in the shared calendar."
msgstr ""
"Faites glisser une carte d'une colonne à l'autre, au rythme réel du dossier."
" Les visites se planifient aussi depuis le dossier, dans le calendrier "
"partagé."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:50
msgid "A file made for a nursing home"
msgstr "Un dossier fait pour une maison de repos"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:52
msgid ""
"Each file carries the **Resident candidate** box, ticked by default. It "
"opens the [candidate's file](dossier-candidat.md) and hides what belongs to "
"a sales pipeline and not to an admission: expected revenue, probability, "
"quotations."
msgstr ""
"Chaque dossier porte la case **Candidat habitant**, cochée par défaut. Elle "
"ouvre le [dossier du candidat](dossier-candidat.md) et masque ce qui relève "
"d'un pipeline commercial et pas d'une admission : revenu attendu, "
"probabilité, devis."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:56
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "En Belgique"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:59
msgid ""
"The file also carries the NISS, the MR/MRS stay type and the MDA "
"insurability check, and starting the stay prepares the admission agreement "
"(eAgreement): see [Admitting a resident in "
"Belgium](../belgique/admission.md)."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier porte aussi le NISS, le type de séjour MR/MRS et la vérification "
"d'assurabilité MDA, et le démarrage du séjour prépare l'accord d'admission "
"(eAgreement) : voir [Admettre un habitant en "
"Belgique](../belgique/admission.md)."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:64
msgid "Giving up an enquiry"
msgstr "Abandonner une demande"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:66
msgid ""
"When an enquiry does not go ahead, click **Give up** on the file and choose "
"the reason:"
msgstr ""
"Quand une demande n'aboutit pas, cliquez sur **Abandonner** sur le dossier "
"et choisissez le motif :"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:69
msgid "**Admitted to another home**"
msgstr "**Admis dans une autre maison de repos**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:70
msgid "**Withdrew — staying at home**"
msgstr "**Renonce — maintien à domicile**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:71
msgid "**Died before admission**"
msgstr "**Décédé avant l'admission**"

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:73
msgid ""
"The reason stays on the file: it is what lets you read, months later, why "
"the place was not taken."
msgstr ""
"Le motif reste sur le dossier : c'est lui qui permet de relire, des mois "
"plus tard, pourquoi la place n'a pas été prise."

#: ../../content/admissions/index.md:76
msgid "What's next"
msgstr "Pour continuer"

